keywords:
  - "topological indices"
  - "QSPR"
  - "orthogonality screening"
  - "bond-incident-degree"
  - "Wuzi index family"
  - "cheminformatics"
abstract: >-
  An open-source pipeline for screening proposed scalar topological indices
  against a 30-index classical baseline on three QSPR regression benchmarks
  (ESOL, FreeSolv, Lipophilicity) and one classification benchmark (BBBP).
  Combines pairwise correlation, principal-component effective rank,
  partial correlation with the target, and variance inflation factor into
  a single combined criterion. Includes a parametric case study, the Wuzi
  index family, and computational extremal-graph searches.
version: "0.1.0"
